        "action": "_resubmit_missing_records_as_batch() creates audit artifacts",
        "what_happens": [
          "1. Check retry_attempt (1) <= MAX_DEPTH (2) ✅",
          "2. _create_retry_manifest() called (first detection)",
          "3. Manifest created with parent_batch info and 5 missing records",
          "4. Reconstruct 5 tasks from context_map",
          "5. Submit retry batch → retry_batch_id: 'batch_customers_retry_1'",
